  "resolution_html": "<p>Using the <strong>Web interface</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"http://listserv.yorku.ca/\">http://listserv.yorku.ca</a></li>\n<li>Open List Management and select List Configuration</li>\n<li>Select list from drop down menu</li>\n<li>Click Security</li>\n<li>Set drop down menu by Confidential= to Yes and click Update</li>\n</ol>",
